  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### Month 12 final pay we’ve done and they are closing the company. How do I do the year end?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2019 at  1:14 PM\n\n\t\tYou have submitted the final submission for the year in the March month FPS. \n\nNow you may simply download the Form P60 from the Reports>> Additional Forms>> P60.\n\nPlease refer to the below link to navigate the same.\n\nReports>> Additional Forms>> P60\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\nClick here to watch how to print a P60 formClick here to watch ho to submit final FPS payroll for the year\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188558\">Payroll FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Month 12 final pay we’ve done and they are closing the company. How do I do the year end?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2019 at  1:14 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You have submitted the final submission for the year in the March month FPS. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Now you may simply download the Form P60 from the Reports&gt;&gt; Additional Forms&gt;&gt; P60.<br><br>Please refer to the below link to navigate the same.<br><br><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/payroll/reports/forms.aspx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Reports&gt;&gt; Additional Forms&gt;&gt; P60</strong></a><br><br>Please refer below screenshot for more help.<br></span></p><p><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/payroll/reports/forms.aspx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/payroll/reports/forms.aspx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074212972/original/C4m6vrs2bgjCxaogC9xDIrmIn19SXznMzQ.png?1553595973\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074212972/original/C4m6vrs2bgjCxaogC9xDIrmIn19SXznMzQ.png?1553595973\" data-fileid=\"9074212972\" data-uniquekey=\"1553595956489\"></a></p><div rel=\"clipboard_data\"><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/386f2a3af9264e308184efbdf01846e6\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to print a P60 form</span></strong></a></div><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/90bc820c61d442e482489b478c0ba1af\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch ho to submit final FPS payroll for the year</span></strong></a></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165669\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165669/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165669\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165669/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165669\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-fee